WEBVTT

01:30.310 --> 01:32.730
Episode 2: How to Make Delicious Hot Cocoa

01:45.310 --> 01:46.520
A disguise.

01:49.990 --> 01:52.180
What a coincidence, Kobato-kun.

01:52.180 --> 01:54.800
Are you by yourself today?

01:55.190 --> 01:55.920
Yeah.

01:56.610 --> 02:00.380
I figured some shopping 
would cheer me up a bit.

02:00.380 --> 02:01.700
Yes, of course.

02:02.310 --> 02:06.000
You had your bike and 
your strawberry tarts stolen.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.430
That doesn't happen often.

02:07.430 --> 02:08.530
It's not that.

02:09.780 --> 02:13.320
That was a while ago, so I'm over it.

02:13.780 --> 02:15.130
Something happen?

02:15.840 --> 02:19.520
Two days ago, I got called to the 
guidance counselor's office.

02:19.520 --> 02:22.700
Ah. Did you get scolded?

02:24.660 --> 02:28.830
Not exactly scolded, 
but I got asked questions.

02:29.770 --> 02:31.310
About my bike.

02:31.310 --> 02:34.330
Your bike? The one that got stolen?

02:34.860 --> 02:35.880
Yeah.

02:35.880 --> 02:39.700
Apparently, they were surprised 
about where it was seen.

02:40.290 --> 02:42.400
Well, at least they found it, right?

02:43.490 --> 02:46.270
"Found it" isn't quite right.

02:46.800 --> 02:49.730
There was a break-in last Sunday.

02:50.170 --> 02:53.750
My bike was spotted then.

02:53.750 --> 02:55.490
Someone saw it?

02:55.830 --> 03:01.030
The break-in was at 
a student's apartment.

03:01.530 --> 03:08.840
The neighbors were suspicious of someone 
loitering like they were on watch.

03:08.840 --> 03:12.000
They remembered my parking 
permit sticker number.

03:12.560 --> 03:13.700
Huh.

03:14.240 --> 03:17.490
That's how it was traced back to me,

03:17.910 --> 03:19.990
and why I was summoned.

03:21.490 --> 03:24.640
They criticized me for letting
my bike get stolen.

03:25.610 --> 03:30.330
So I got bummed out and 
decided I wanted to go shopping.

03:30.330 --> 03:31.310
I see.

03:37.430 --> 03:40.420
I felt so hurt.

03:42.040 --> 03:43.360
Saint Marc...

03:44.350 --> 03:47.160
It's a tasty shop nearby.

03:47.850 --> 03:50.780
Saint Marc... Cakes, was it?

03:50.780 --> 03:54.740
With lovely, fragrant caramel jelly.

03:56.460 --> 03:58.800
All right. My treat.

04:00.550 --> 04:03.050
Theater Road

04:03.440 --> 04:04.730
It's Kengo.

04:05.550 --> 04:11.810
You're free, right?

04:07.050 --> 04:11.810
I'm walking

04:08.810 --> 04:11.810
So you're free.
I'll invite you over

