I'll invite you over

04:12.020 --> 04:13.060
Come over

04:13.060 --> 04:13.190
So you're free.
I'll invite you over

04:13.060 --> 04:13.190
Come over

04:13.060 --> 04:13.190
I'm on a walk with 
Osanai-san. Later

04:13.190 --> 04:13.310
So you're free.
I'll invite you over

04:13.190 --> 04:13.310
Come over

04:13.190 --> 04:13.310
I'm on a walk with 
